sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Scopegate verified invitation and single-use acceptance
    accDescr: Creation atomically persists a reviewed plan and encrypted outbox. Worker delivery is postcommit, verified acceptance locks and rechecks current scope, receipt and expiry.
    autonumber
    actor Manager as Access Manager
    participant API as Scopegate API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as Outbox Worker
    participant Adapter as Delivery Adapter
    actor Recipient
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider

    Manager->>API: Request invitation and project resources
    API->>DB: Begin transaction and acquire ordered locks
    API->>DB: Validate manager and active entitlements
    API->>DB: Insert pending token digest and resource references
    API->>DB: Insert audit event and encrypted outbox payload
    API->>DB: Commit
    API-->>Manager: Invitation created
    Worker->>DB: Claim committed item with lease and generation, commit
    Worker->>Adapter: Deliver bounded invitation link
    Adapter-->>Recipient: Invitation link
    Worker->>DB: Acknowledge current lease token and generation
    Note over Worker,DB: Delivery may repeat after a crash.<br/>Purge follows terminal retention.

    Note over Recipient,API: Invitation secret is removed from the URL before login.<br/>OIDC redirects carry no invitation secret.
    Recipient->>API: Start login for recipient preview
    API-->>Recipient: Redirect with state, nonce and S256 challenge
    Recipient->>OIDC: Authenticate at configured issuer
    OIDC-->>Recipient: Redirect callback with code and state
    Recipient->>API: Browser-bound callback
    API->>OIDC: Exchange code and verifier, validate configured JWKS
    OIDC-->>API: Signed issuer, subject, verified email and auth_time
    API->>DB: Store trusted claims in opaque session
    Recipient->>API: Preview invitation using session and token
    API->>DB: Match digest and recipient using fresh claims
    API-->>Recipient: Organization and bounded resource plan without acceptance
    Recipient->>API: Confirm acceptance with token and idempotency key
    API->>DB: Begin transaction and lock sorted resource rows
    API->>DB: Acquire exclusive organization lock
    API->>DB: Lock applicable membership then invitation state
    API->>DB: Recheck current session recipient binding and 15 minute auth freshness
    alt Invalid identity recipient binding or stale authentication
        API->>DB: Roll back
        API-->>Recipient: Safe refusal or reauthentication requirement
    else Current recipient verified
        API->>DB: Read actor scoped receipt and compare request fingerprint
        alt Matching receipt exists
            API->>DB: End transaction without another state transition
            API-->>Recipient: Recorded acceptance result
        else Key reused with different fingerprint
            API->>DB: Roll back
            API-->>Recipient: Idempotency conflict
        else No matching receipt
            API->>DB: Recheck pending state expiry and entitlements after waits
            alt Invalid token state or entitlement
                API->>DB: Roll back
                API-->>Recipient: Safe refusal without private target data
            else Valid invitation and permitted membership transition
                API->>DB: Reuse identity and membership or create membership
                API->>DB: Apply explicit grants by difference
                API->>DB: Mark accepted and append audit and receipt
                API->>DB: Commit atomically
                API-->>Recipient: Scoped access ready
            end
        end
    end
    Note over API,DB: Suspended members stay suspended.<br/>Existing manager role is preserved.<br/>Replay creates no new acceptance.
